cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SAr-adapted — Sentinel-1 C-band InSAR evaluation over the Rzecin floating fen"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sayoud
    given-names: Aimen
repository-code: "https://github.com/AimenSayoud/SAr-adapted"
abstract: >-
  Analysis library, multi-sensor data-cube pipeline, pre-registered scoring
  protocol, and figure generation scripts for evaluating Sentinel-1 C-band
  interferometric SAR routes against continuous laser surface-elevation and
  piezometer measurements on a floating poor-fen mat (Rzecin, Poland, 2017–2026).
keywords:
  - InSAR
  - Sentinel-1
  - peatland
  - floating fen
  - Schwingmoor
  - coherence
  - bog breathing
  - validation
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
